        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "User Input Message Decoder"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771403720389"
          },
          "code": "USER_INPUT_MESSAGE_DECODER",
          "id": "1771402747757",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771402747758_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "- Task: Classify the user’s intent from inputMessage into two boolean flags:\n  - withoutSuccessionPlans: true if the message is about employees without / no / missing / lacking succession plans.\n  - withSuccessionPlans: true if the message is about employees with succession plans OR about ready-now candidates\n- If the message asks for a complete/overall/both summary, set both flags to true.\n- If the intent is unclear or unrelated, set both flags to true.\n\n- Be case-insensitive and handle common synonyms:\n  - \"ready now\", \"ready-now\", \"ready now candidates\", \"ready-now candidates\", \"ready now employees\" -> withSuccessionPlans = true\n  - \"without/no/missing/lack of succession plan(s)\" -> withoutSuccessionPlans = true\n  - \"with/have/has succession plan(s)/ready now candidates\" -> withSuccessionPlans = true\n  - \"complete/overall/full summary\", \"both\", \"all (with and without)\" -> both true\n\n- Output strictly a single JSON object with boolean values and exactly these keys:\n  {\"withoutSuccessionPlans\": <true|false>, \"withSuccessionPlans\": <true|false>}\n- Do not include any extra text.\n\nUser input\n{{$context.$variables.inputMessage}} \n\nOutput format\n{\"withoutSuccessionPlans\": true/false, \"withSuccessionPlans\": true/false}\n\nExamples\n\nInput: \"Show employees without succession plans.\"\nOutput: {\"withoutSuccessionPlans\": true, \"withSuccessionPlans\": false}\n\nInput: \"Show employees with succession plans.\"\nOutput: {\"withoutSuccessionPlans\": false, \"withSuccessionPlans\": true}\n\nInput: \"Show employees without ready now candidates.\"\nOutput: {\"withoutSuccessionPlans\": false, \"withSuccessionPlans\": true} (topic is ready-now → withSuccessionPlans true)\n\nInput: \"Give me a complete succession summary for my team.\"\nOutput: {\"withoutSuccessionPlans\": true, \"withSuccessionPlans\": true}\n\nInput: \"Show both with and without succession plans.\"\nOutput: {\"withoutSuccessionPlans\": true, \"withSuccessionPlans\": true}\n\nInput: \"Succession coverage overview (with and without).\"\nOutput: {\"withoutSuccessionPlans\": true, \"withSuccessionPlans\": true}\n\nInput: \"Who’s on vacation next week?\"\nOutput: {\"withoutSuccessionPlans\": false, \"withSuccessionPlans\": false}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
